{"last_link_id": 4, "nodes": [{"mode": 0, "outputs": [{"shape": 6, "name": "文本", "links": [3], "label": "文本", "type": "STRING", "localized_name": "文本"}], "size": [400, 200], "pos": [990.310791015625, 974.453857421875], "widgets_values": ["红黑帮会议室-夜\n△炸裂开场：特写镜头。一只沉重的皮靴狠狠踢在西装男的后膝弯上。伴随着骨头碰撞的闷响。\n△西装男失去平衡，重重地跪倒在地毯上，手中的文件散落一地。\n西装男: (Gasps in pain)\n△黑衣男站在西装男面前，脸上挂着残忍的戏谑笑容，缓缓抬起那只皮靴，伸到西装男的鼻子底下。\n黑衣男: You know the drill, number cruncher. Make it shine.\n△周围的GANG MEMBERS爆发出一阵刺耳的哄笑声，有人吹口样，有人举起手机拍摄\nGANG MEMBER 1: Look at him! Like a trained dog!\n△西装男抬起头，厚重的黑框眼镜歪斜在鼻梁上。他没有愤怒，只有满脸堆积的讨好和恐惧。\nIAN: Yes, sir. Right away, Rico. Sorry about that.\n△西装男颤抖着脱下自己那件廉价的灰色西装外套。\n△特写：西装男用自己的衣袖，用力擦拭着黑衣男满是灰尘的皮靴，动作卑微到了尘埃里。\nRICO: Harder! I want to see my face in it!\n"], "inputs": [{"widget": {"name": "编辑文本"}, "name": "编辑文本", "label": "编辑文本", "type": "STRING", "localized_name": "编辑文本"}], "flags": {}, "id": 3, "type": "MuyeTextEditOutput", "properties": {"widget_ue_connectable": {}, "Node name for S&R": "MuyeTextEditOutput"}, "order": 0}, {"mode": 0, "outputs": [{"name": "IMAGE", "links": [4], "label": "图像", "type": "IMAGE", "localized_name": "图像"}, {"name": "MASK", "label": "遮罩", "type": "MASK", "localized_name": "遮罩"}], "size": [270, 314], "pos": [1006.82958984375, 610.92041015625], "widgets_values": ["6b7a9bf90715f450dfb83ee13aaa1eb7c930b574c78ee93497bef37a20794a83.png", "image"], "inputs": [{"widget": {"name": "image"}, "name": "image", "type": "COMBO", "localized_name": "图像"}, {"widget": {"name": "upload"}, "name": "upload", "type": "IMAGEUPLOAD", "localized_name": "选择文件上传"}], "flags": {}, "id": 5, "type": "LoadImage", "properties": {"cnr_id": "comfy-core", "ver": "0.3.71", "widget_ue_connectable": {}, "Node name for S&R": "LoadImage"}, "order": 1}, {"mode": 0, "outputs": [{"name": "video", "links": [1], "label": "video", "type": "VIDEO", "localized_name": "video"}], "size": [400, 208], "pos": [1417.82421875, 638.9071044921875], "widgets_values": ["", "9:16", "720P", 15, 2020619526, "random